{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】緬甸軍政府公開被軟禁的前國務資政昂山素姬最新照片。</p><p>發言人周一公布，政府官員當天上午在內比都與昂山素姬見面約十分鐘，並向她轉交了英王查理斯三世寄給昂山素姬的信件及兩本書。</p><p>81歲的昂山素姬，政變後一度累計判監33年，之後獲減刑及改為軟禁，目前仍有18年刑期。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:06.511592+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":0,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T05:30:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T16:38:13.716436+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:58:12.125602+00:00","content_hash":"3fe6a6cd60cd94a7fbfdfdfb161260c026b2fb7da7f27cf02e3383eed0e432e6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}